<title>GREECE: PROFESSOR BITROS TO RUN ON ND PARTY TICKET.</title>
<headline>PROFESSOR BITROS TO RUN ON ND PARTY TICKET.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Professor George Bitros, an economics professor and aide to former conservative minister Andreas Andrianopoulos, will be a candidate in the first district of Pireaus with the conservative New Democracy party, he told Reuters.</p>
<p>Bitros is an advisor of New Democracy party president Miltiadis Evert on economic affairs. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
